From: Win7 port restore
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] desktop/index.html: Chromium 108 CSS shim

Electron 22 renders with Chromium 108. The UI (Tailwind v4 + design tokens)
uses color-mix() (111+), scrollbar-color (121+), transition:overlay (114+) and
lab()/oklch()/lch()/oklab() colors (111+). On 108 those declarations are
dropped outright. This inline shim (placed after the theme <style>, before
the boot watchdog):
  - feature-detects and no-ops on Chromium >= 114
  - evaluates color-mix() and lab-family functions against live theme
    custom properties, rewriting declarations through the CSSOM
  - injects ::-webkit-scrollbar fallbacks
  - re-runs on data-theme switches and late <style>/<link> inserts

Byte-identical to the block shipped in the restored Offline installer
(resources/app.asar.unpacked/dist/index.html lines 120-580).

